Trombone is free software under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or later. That stoplist is included verbatim under the
same license. Its header points at the TAPoRware Glasgow stoplist
(http://taporware.mcmaster.ca/).

The remaining analysis code was written from published statistical
definitions of relative frequency, per-document z-score, tf-idf and
Pearson correlation. It does not copy Trombone, Voyant or VoyantServer
source. Those projects are licensed under the GNU General Public
License version 3:

