  https://github.com/voyanttools/trombone/blob/master/LICENSE.txt

"Voyant" and "Voyant Tools" name the original project by Stéfan
Sinclair and Geoffrey Rockwell. This repository is an independent
reimplementation. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or a
substitute for Voyant Tools.

